# Global instructions (Hermes)

This file loads into Hermes sessions on this machine through `~/.hermes/SOUL.md`.
It starts intentionally minimal. Add portable instructions here and keep credentials,
private memory, transcripts, and machine state outside `content/`.

## Workflow

- Add planning, confirmation, testing, and communication preferences here.

## Skill Auto-Trigger

Shared Skills live in `../../skills/` and are linked to `~/.hermes/skills`.
Before starting a task, check for a matching Skill and read its `SKILL.md`.
